      "content": "it wasn't just a mistake though. it was something i did that actually hurt people in a way they can't just move past. i see it in their faces. it's like i've fundamentally broken something. i feel like if i'm still around just taking up space and resources, it's actually worse than if i just wasn't here. i'm just a net negative to everyone.",
